          "script": "\t\u0027\u0027\u0027\n\tGiven a paramsDict dictionary of the following keys:\n\tparamsDict (dictionary)\n\t\t\t - assetPath (string)\n\t\t\t - startDate (datetime)\n\t\t\t - endDate (datetime)\n\t\t\t - modeId (int)\n\t\t\t - workOrderId (int)\n\t\t\t - activeModeOnly (bool)\n\t\t\t - strictDates (bool): If true then counts and times will be limited to the range passed in, otherwise counts and times are for the entire run that started or ended during the range\t\n\tTakes any level of asset, and drills down until we get to the line level assets and its production runs.\n\tWe can get the OEE of each production run, and then aggregate OEE of the overall line, then bubble back up to area, site, and finally enterprise.\n\t\n\tRecursive Solution\n\tGiven a nested tree list, which contains assets and their children: each tree item contains its own assetInfo, and a list of children \u0027items\u0027\n\tExample: \u0027Kanoa Industries\u0027 enterprise asset passed in as the assetPath\n\tStarting from the top level asset:\n\t- Iterate through each of its site child assets (First child Tacoma)\n\t- See that Tacoma has child assets, recurse and iterate through each of its area child assets (First child Packaging)\n\t- See that Tacoma/Packaging has child assets, recurse and iterate through each of its line child assets\n\t- See that Line 1 is an OEE_Enabled asset, recursion stops here and we query Line 1\u0027s production runs\n\t\t- Iterate through each production run, and store each run\u0027s individual OEE\n\t\t- Accumulate metric totals of all the runs, and use it to calculate the line\u0027s overall OEE\n\t- Continue to iterate through the lines, record their production run OEE\u0027s, and line overall OEE\u0027s\n\t- Back to the Packaging area, now that we have the accumulated metrics of all the lines, calculate the area\u0027s overall OEE\n\t- Continue to iterate through the areas, record their overall OEE\u0027s\n\t- Back to the Tacoma site, now that we have the accumulated metrics of all the areas, calculate the site\u0027s overall OEE\n\t- Continue to iterate through the sites, record their overall OEE\u0027s\n\t- Back to the Kanoa Industries enterprise, now that we have the accumulated metrics of all the sites, calculate the enterprise\u0027s overall OEE\n\t\n\tStarting from the very bottom when we get to the line level asset:\n\t- query its production runs, store the OEE per production run in the list\n\t- obtain the total metrics needed to calculate OEE for the line\n\t- given the OEE/metrics for each line, can now calculate OEE for the area\n\t\n\tReturns:\n\tassetOEE (list[dict]), productionOEE (list[dict])\n\t\n\t\u0027\u0027\u0027\n\t\n\t########################################################################################\n\tdef sumRunOEE(runs):\n\t\t\n#\t\tsystem.perspective.print(\"Calling sumRunOEE(0 with %s\"%runs)\n\t\truntimeSecs \u003d 0.0\n\t\tunplannedDowntimeSecs \u003d 0.0\n\t\ttargetCount \u003d 0.0\n\t\tinfeedCount \u003d 0.0\n\t\toutfeedCount \u003d 0.0\n\t\twasteCount \u003d 0.0\n\t\t\n\t\tfor row in runs:\n\t\t\tif row[\u0027modeName\u0027] !\u003d \u0027Production\u0027: continue\n\t\t\truntimeSecs +\u003d row[\u0027runtimeSecs\u0027] or 0.0\n\t\t\tunplannedDowntimeSecs +\u003d row[\u0027unplannedDowntimeSecs\u0027] or 0.0\n\t\t\ttargetCount +\u003d row[\u0027targetCount\u0027] or row[\u0027infeedCount\u0027]or 0.0\n\t\t\tinfeedCount +\u003d row[\u0027infeedCount\u0027] or 0.0\n\t\t\toutfeedCount +\u003d row[\u0027outfeedCount\u0027] or 0.0\n\t\t\twasteCount +\u003d row[\u0027wasteCount\u0027] or 0.0\n\t\t\t\n\t\ta \u003d runtimeSecs / (runtimeSecs + unplannedDowntimeSecs) if (runtimeSecs + unplannedDowntimeSecs) \u003e 0 else 0\n\t\tp \u003d infeedCount / targetCount if targetCount \u003e 0.0 else 1.0\n\t\tq \u003d (infeedCount - wasteCount) / infeedCount if infeedCount \u003e 0.0 else 1.0\n\t\n\t\treturn \t{\"oee\": a * min(p, 1.0) * q, \"a\": a, \"p\": p, \"q\": q, \u0027runtimeSecs\u0027: runtimeSecs, \u0027unplannedDowntimeSecs\u0027: unplannedDowntimeSecs, \u0027targetCount\u0027: targetCount, \u0027infeedCount\u0027: infeedCount, \u0027outfeedCount\u0027: outfeedCount, \u0027wasteCount\u0027: wasteCount}\n\t\t\n\t########################################################################################\n\tdef sumOEE(metrics):\n\n\t\truntimeSecs \u003d metrics[\u0027runtimeSecs\u0027] or 0.0\n\t\tunplannedDowntimeSecs \u003d metrics[\u0027unplannedDowntimeSecs\u0027] or 0.0\n\t\ttargetCount \u003d metrics[\u0027targetCount\u0027] or 0.0\n\t\tinfeedCount \u003d metrics[\u0027infeedCount\u0027] or 0.0\n\t\toutfeedCount \u003d metrics[\u0027outfeedCount\u0027] or 0.0\n\t\twasteCount \u003d metrics[\u0027wasteCount\u0027] or 0.0\n\t\t\t\n\t\ta \u003d runtimeSecs / (runtimeSecs + unplannedDowntimeSecs) if (runtimeSecs + unplannedDowntimeSecs) \u003e 0 else 0.0\n\t\tp \u003d infeedCount / targetCount if targetCount \u003e 0.0 else 1.0\n#\t\tif p \u003e 1: p \u003d 1.0\n\t\tq \u003d (infeedCount - wasteCount) / infeedCount if infeedCount \u003e 0.0 else 1.0\n\t\n\t\treturn \t{\"oee\": a * min(p, 1.0) * q, \"a\": a, \"p\": p, \"q\": q, \u0027runtimeSecs\u0027: runtimeSecs, \u0027unplannedDowntimeSecs\u0027: unplannedDowntimeSecs, \u0027targetCount\u0027: targetCount, \u0027infeedCount\u0027: infeedCount, \u0027outfeedCount\u0027: outfeedCount, \u0027wasteCount\u0027: wasteCount}\n\t\t\n\t########################################################################################\n\tdef processLevel(level):\n\t\t\n#\t\tsystem.perspective.print(\"\")\n#\t\tsystem.perspective.print(\"Calling processLevel()\")\n\t\t\n\t\tdef addMetrics(metrics):\n\t\t\ttotalMetrics[\u0027runtimeSecs\u0027] +\u003d metrics[\u0027runtimeSecs\u0027]\n\t\t\ttotalMetrics[\u0027unplannedDowntimeSecs\u0027] +\u003d metrics[\u0027unplannedDowntimeSecs\u0027]\n\t\t\ttotalMetrics[\u0027targetCount\u0027] +\u003d metrics[\u0027targetCount\u0027]\n\t\t\ttotalMetrics[\u0027infeedCount\u0027] +\u003d metrics[\u0027infeedCount\u0027]\n\t\t\ttotalMetrics[\u0027outfeedCount\u0027] +\u003d metrics[\u0027outfeedCount\u0027]\n\t\t\ttotalMetrics[\u0027wasteCount\u0027] +\u003d metrics[\u0027wasteCount\u0027]\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\t\n\t\ttotalMetrics \u003d {\u0027runtimeSecs\u0027: 0.0, \u0027unplannedDowntimeSecs\u0027: 0.0, \u0027targetCount\u0027: 0.0, \u0027infeedCount\u0027: 0.0, \u0027outfeedCount\u0027: 0.0, \u0027wasteCount\u0027: 0.0}\n\t\tchildOEEList \u003d []\n\t\t\n\t\tfor item in level:\n#\t\t\tsystem.perspective.print(\"----------------\")\n#\t\t\tsystem.perspective.print(\"Processing %s\"%(item[\u0027data\u0027][\u0027assetPath\u0027]))\t\t\t\n\t\t\tif item[\u0027data\u0027].has_key(\u0027oeeEnabled\u0027) and item[\u0027data\u0027][\u0027oeeEnabled\u0027]:\n\t\t\t\tassetParamsDict \u003d dict(paramsDict)\n\t\t\t\tassetParamsDict[\u0027assetId\u0027] \u003d item[\u0027data\u0027][\u0027assetId\u0027]\n\t\t\t\tproductionEvents \u003d system.kanoa.utilities.convertDatasetToJSON(system.kanoa.event.getAssetProductionEvents(assetParamsDict))\n\t\t\t\tfor event in productionEvents:\n\t\t\t\t\tproductionOEE[\u0027%s - %s\u0027%(event[\u0027assetPath\u0027], event[\u0027workOrderId\u0027])] \u003d sumRunOEE([event])\n\t\t\t\tlineOEE \u003d sumRunOEE(productionEvents)\n\t\t\t\tadditional \u003d item[\u0027data\u0027][\u0027assetPath\u0027].replace(initialPath, \u0027\u0027)\n\t\t\t\tpathSections \u003d [section for section in ([initialPath] + additional.split(\u0027\\\\\u0027)) if section]\n\t\t\t\tlineOEE[\u0027level\u0027] \u003d len(pathSections)\n\t\t\t\tlineOEE[\u0027assetPath\u0027] \u003d item[\u0027data\u0027][\u0027assetPath\u0027]\n\t\t\t\tlineOEE[\u0027assetInfo\u0027] \u003d assetDict[item[\u0027data\u0027][\u0027assetPath\u0027]]\n\t\t\t\tassetOEE[item[\u0027data\u0027][\u0027assetPath\u0027]] \u003d lineOEE\n\t\t\t\taddMetrics(lineOEE)\n\t\t\telse:\n#\t\t\t\tsystem.perspective.print(\"Calling processLevel() for nonOEEEnabled asset %s with items\"%(item[\u0027data\u0027][\u0027assetPath\u0027]))\n\t\t\t\tchildOEE \u003d sumOEE(processLevel(item[\u0027items\u0027]))\n\t\t\t\tif item[\u0027data\u0027][\u0027assetPath\u0027] \u003d\u003d \u0027Kanoa Industries\\Buffalo Bakery\u0027: system.perspective.print(\"processLevel() for nonOEEEnabledAsset %s returned %s\"%(item[\u0027data\u0027][\u0027assetPath\u0027], childOEE))\n\t\t\t\titemPath \u003d str(item[\u0027data\u0027][\u0027assetPath\u0027])\n\t\t\t\tadditional \u003d itemPath.replace(initialPath, \u0027\u0027)\n\t\t\t\tpathSections \u003d [section for section in ([initialPath] + additional.split(\u0027\\\\\u0027)) if section]\n\t\t\t\tchildOEE[\u0027level\u0027] \u003d len(pathSections)\n\t\t\t\tchildOEE[\u0027assetPath\u0027] \u003d item[\u0027data\u0027][\u0027assetPath\u0027]\n\t\t\t\tchildOEE[\u0027assetInfo\u0027] \u003d assetDict[item[\u0027data\u0027][\u0027assetPath\u0027]]\n\t\t\t\tassetOEE[item[\u0027data\u0027][\u0027assetPath\u0027]] \u003d childOEE\n\t\t\t\taddMetrics(childOEE)\n\t\t\n\t\treturn totalMetrics\n\t\t\n\tif paramsDict[\u0027assetPath\u0027] is None: return {}\n\t\n\tinitialPath \u003d paramsDict[\u0027assetPath\u0027]\n\tassetPath \u003d paramsDict[\u0027assetPath\u0027] if \u0027%\u0027 in paramsDict[\u0027assetPath\u0027] else paramsDict[\u0027assetPath\u0027] + \u0027%\u0027\n\t# Get all assets under the passed in asset\n\tassets \u003d system.kanoa.asset.getAssets({\u0027assetPath\u0027: assetPath})\n\tassetDict \u003d system.kanoa.utilities.convertListToDict(system.kanoa.utilities.convertDatasetToJSON(assets), \u0027assetPath\u0027)\n\tassetOEE \u003d {}\n\tproductionOEE \u003d {}\n\t\t\t\t\n\tassetTree \u003d self.buildTree(assets, paramsDict[\u0027assetPath\u0027])\n\tassetOEE[paramsDict[\u0027assetPath\u0027]] \u003d sumOEE(processLevel(assetTree))\n\tassetOEE[paramsDict[\u0027assetPath\u0027]][\u0027level\u0027] \u003d 1\n\tassetOEE[paramsDict[\u0027assetPath\u0027]][\u0027assetPath\u0027] \u003d paramsDict[\u0027assetPath\u0027]\n\tassetOEE[paramsDict[\u0027assetPath\u0027]][\u0027assetInfo\u0027] \u003d assetDict[paramsDict[\u0027assetPath\u0027]]\n\t\n\treturn assetOEE"
        },
        {
          "name": "buildTree",
          "params": [
            "data",
            "initialPath"
          ],
          "script": "\t\n\tdata \u003d system.dataset.toPyDataSet(data)\n\ttreePath \u003d \u0027path\u0027\n\tpathLengths \u003d []\n\tfor row in data:\n\t\tpath \u003d row[treePath]\n\t\tadditional \u003d path.replace(initialPath, \u0027\u0027)\n\t\tpathLengths.append(1 + len(additional.split(\u0027\\\\\u0027)))\n\tminPathLength \u003d min(pathLengths)\n\tdata \u003d system.dataset.addColumn(data, 0, pathLengths, \u0027pathLength\u0027, int)\n\tdata \u003d system.dataset.sort(data, \u0027pathLength\u0027, True)\n\t\n\thasIconColor \u003d \u0027iconColor\u0027 in data.getColumnNames()\n\tif \u0027iconPath\u0027 in data.getColumnNames(): iconCol \u003d \u0027iconPath\u0027\n\telif \u0027icon\u0027 in data.getColumnNames(): iconCol \u003d \u0027icon\u0027\n\telse: iconCol \u003d None\n\t\n\ttreeItems \u003d []\n\ttreeLookup \u003d {}\n\t\n\tdef initializeNode(pathSection, parent, level, iconPath, color):\n\t\tif level !\u003d len(parent)-1: iconPath \u003d \u0027\u0027\t#Make the folder levels be the default icon\n\t\tnodePath \u003d \u0027\\\\\u0027.join(parent[:level+1])\n\t\treturn {\n\t\t\t\t\u0027label\u0027: pathSection,\n\t\t\t\t\u0027expanded\u0027: False,\n\t\t\t\t\u0027data\u0027: {\u0027path\u0027: nodePath,\u0027label\u0027: pathSection, \u0027treeLevel\u0027: level},\n\t\t\t\t\u0027items\u0027: [],\n\t\t\t\t\u0027icon\u0027:{\u0027path\u0027: iconPath, \u0027color\u0027: color}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\n\tdef buildBranch(row):\n\t\tpath \u003d data.getValueAt(row, treePath) or \u0027\u0027\n\t\tadditional \u003d path.replace(initialPath, \u0027\u0027)\n\t\tpathSections \u003d [item for item in ([initialPath] + additional.split(\u0027\\\\\u0027)) if item]\n\t\ticonPath \u003d data.getValueAt(row, iconCol) if iconCol else None\n\t\ticonColor \u003d data.getValueAt(row, \u0027iconColor\u0027) if hasIconColor else None\n\t\t\n\t\tpointerItems \u003d treeItems\n\t\tpointerLookup \u003d treeLookup\n\t\t\n\t\tfor level, section in enumerate(pathSections):\n\t\t\tnodesAtLevel \u003d len(pointerItems)\n\t\t\tif section in pointerLookup:\n\t\t\t\tpointerLookup \u003d pointerLookup[section]\n\t\t\t\tpointerItems \u003d pointerItems[pointerLookup[\u0027index\u0027]][\u0027items\u0027]\n\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\tpointerLookup[section] \u003d {\u0027name\u0027: section, \u0027index\u0027: nodesAtLevel, \u0027children\u0027: {}}\n\t\t\t\tpointerLookup \u003d pointerLookup[section]\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tpointerItems.append(initializeNode(section, pathSections, level, iconPath, iconColor))\n\t\t\t\totherColumns \u003d data.getColumnNames()\n\t\t\t\tfor column in otherColumns:\n\t\t\t\t\tpointerItems[-1][\u0027data\u0027][column] \u003d data.getValueAt(row, column)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tpointerItems \u003d pointerItems[pointerLookup[\u0027index\u0027]][\u0027items\u0027]\n\t\t\t\t\n\tfor row in range(data.getRowCount()): buildBranch(row)\n\treturn treeItems"
        },
